  "bodyHash": "ca8b271acc404b04",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模组。用心打造。为 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"关于模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Tree Harvester（树木收割者）是一款可配置的模组，允许你通过砍伐一个基座方块来瞬间收割树木、诡异菌木树和巨型蘑菇。这可以是树的任何部分。树苗会自动掉落并替换，使用树木掉落的物品。模组中进行了许多检查，从防止意外收割由原木建造的房屋到确定哪些树叶会腐烂。<br><br>默认情况下，只有在按住潜行键时才能进行收割，但这可以在配置文件中切换。更多功能示例见下文。有许多配置选项可以精确调整模组以符合你的喜好。<br><br>旨在与我的<a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ore-harvester\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ore Harvester（矿石收割者）</a>模组配合使用。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>默认配置设置下的功能：</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>所有树木，包括原版和模组添加的，都可以通过蹲下并砍伐一个方块来快速收割。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>砍倒一棵树所需的时间取决于其中的原木数量。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>收割树木后，树叶会迅速腐烂。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>在最后一块树叶腐烂后，树苗会被替换。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>下界的诡异菌木树可以快速收割。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>巨型蘑菇也可以快速收割<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>某些类型的斧头可以通过黑名单排除在树木收割之外。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>许多检查以确定什么是树，什么不是。不会意外摧毁房屋。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>当两种树木相邻时，只有被破坏的树木的树叶会腐烂。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>与其他模组兼容。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"包含在 The Vanilla Experience 中\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/qol-bundle.svg\" alt=\"包含在 Serilum 的生活质量包中\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"环境：服务器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的配置选项：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>mustHoldAxeForTreeHarvest</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">如果启用，玩家必须在主手中持有斧头时才能进行树木收割。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>treeHarvestWithoutSneak</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">如果启用，不按潜行键时也可以进行树木收割。如果禁用，则反转逻辑，仅在潜行时有效。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>automaticallyFindBottomBlock</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">模组是否应尝试找到树木的实际底部原木并从那里开始。这意味着你可以在树的中间打破它，它仍然会被完全砍倒。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableFastLeafDecay</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">如果启用，被破坏树木周围的树叶将迅速消失。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableNetherTrees</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">如果启用，下界的诡异菌木/绯红菌木树也将被快速砍倒。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableHugeMushrooms</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">如果启用，巨型蘑菇也将被快速砍倒。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>ignorePlayerMadeTrees</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">如果启用，由玩家放置树叶的树木不会被销毁。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>replaceSaplingOnTreeHarvest</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">如果启用，在收割树木时自动用掉落的物品替换树苗。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>replaceMushroomOnMushroomHarvest</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">如果启用，在收割巨型蘑菇且“enableHugeMushrooms”启用时，自动用掉落的物品替换蘑菇块。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>loseDurabilityPerHarvestedLog</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">如果启用，每收割一个原木，持有的斧头就会损失耐久度。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>loseDurabilityModifier</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 1.0，最小值 0.001，最大值 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">在这里你可以设置砍倒一棵树应该从斧头上扣除多少耐久度。例如，如果设置为 0.1，这意味着每 10 个原木消耗 1 点耐久度。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>increaseExhaustionPerHarvestedLog</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">如果启用，玩家的疲劳值每收割一个原木增加 0.005（Minecraft 默认的每破坏一个方块）* increaseExhaustionModifier。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>increaseExhaustionModifier</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 1.0，最小值 0.001，最大值 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">这决定了每收割一个原木应该给玩家增加多少疲劳值。默认为 0.005 * 1.0。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>increaseHarvestingTimePerLog</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">如果启用，收割时间会随着树木中现有的原木数量而增加。数量由“increasedHarvestingTimePerLogModifier”决定。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>increasedHarvestingTimePerLogModifier</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 0.1，最小值 0.01，最大值 10.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用“increaseHarvestingTimePerLog”后，收割一棵树需要更长的时间。实际速度为：newSpeed = originalSpeed / (1 + (logCount * increasedHarvestingTimePerLogModifier))。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>amountOfLeavesBrokenPerTick</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 3，最小值 1，最大值 16</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">收割树木后，每刻应该破坏多少树叶。增加此值将加快树叶快速腐烂的速度，但每刻会消耗更多的处理能力。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>斧头黑名单功能：</strong></span><br>可以仅允许特定的斧头收割树木。在模组首次加载时，会生成一个黑名单文件。它位于 <strong><em>./config/treeharvester/harvestable_axe_blacklist.txt</em></strong>。这也适用于模组添加的斧头物品。<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/blacklist.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>在白桦树旁边收割橡树。只有白桦树的树叶在腐烂：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/birch_only.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>一棵巨大的橡树：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/big_oak_only.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>一棵 2x2 的云杉树。砍倒这棵树所需的时间更长，并且所有 4 棵树苗都被正确替换：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/big_spruce.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>支持诡异菌木（下界）树：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/nether_tree.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>也适用于巨型蘑菇，这里有一个棕色的：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/brown_mushroom.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>还有一个红色的蘑菇：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/red_mushroom.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"备注和链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>你可以自由地在任何整合包中使用此模组，只要下载仍托管在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态系统中。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有可用模组的概览和更多信息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">评论已禁用，因为我无法在许多单独的模组页面之间跟踪它们。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>对于问题、想法、建议或其他任何事情，请前往 <a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
